%% Bounded Agent lifecycle / 有界 Agent 生命周期
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Accepted
    Accepted --> Validating: validate request / 校验请求
    Validating --> Running: valid request / 请求有效
    Validating --> Failed: invalid request / 请求无效
    Running --> CallingModel: invoke model / 调用模型
    CallingModel --> Running: delta / bounded continuation / 增量 / 有界继续
    Running --> CallingTool: allowlisted + authorized / 已允许且已授权
    CallingTool --> Running: validated result / 结果已校验
    CallingTool --> Failed: denied / invalid / tool error / 拒绝 / 无效 / 工具错误
    Running --> Finalizing: answer ready / 答复就绪
    Running --> Cancelled: cancel / client disconnect / 取消 / 客户端断开
    CallingModel --> Failed: timeout / provider error / 超时 / 供应商错误
    Running --> Failed: iteration or time budget exceeded / 超过迭代或时间预算
    Finalizing --> Completed: Core confirms persistence / Core 确认持久化
    Finalizing --> Failed: persistence failure / 持久化失败
    Completed --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]
